Description: fast, modern and secure web-based email client
 Tachyon is a PHP 8.2+ webmail client forked from SnappyMail.
 It supports IMAP, SMTP and Sieve protocols, multiple accounts and identities,
 an admin panel for configuration, and a modern theme with light/dark/system
 mode support. Plugins can be installed to extend functionality.
 Emails are not stored locally; they are accessed through IMAP.
